# Keep the vendored SDKs out of the language statistics. Both are submodules, so
# linguist already ignores them -- this is here so that a future dependency that
# is vendored in-tree rather than as a submodule is covered from the start.
#
# It named external/stb, external/dr_libs and external/openfx until v0.1.0. None
# of the three has ever existed in this repo; the file arrived from a sibling and
# nothing notices a linguist rule that matches no path.
external/* linguist-vendored
